{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Fast. Drive Far. Unlock It All.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Velocity Racing: 1000</i> is a sleek, high-speed third - and first-person racing game created by a <strong>solo developer</strong> over 9 months. With sharp visuals, responsive vehicle handling, and full race customization, this is pure racing distilled into a tight, replayable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f <strong>21 Unlockable Cars</strong> \u2013 Each with unique stats and designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>5 Diverse Maps</strong> \u2013 From winding forest roads to high-speed asphalt circuits (more maps coming!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Race Settings</strong> \u2013 Choose weather (including snow &amp; storms), day/night, laps, and NPC difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Customization</strong> \u2013 Pick your car color, view handling stats, and fine-tune race rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcca <strong>Progression System</strong> \u2013 Unlock vehicles by driving longer distances and winning races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Steam Co-op Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Join or host races with friends using Steam lobbies, with in-game and lobby chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 End-of-race stats and global rankings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Crisp VFX and Smooth Controls</strong> \u2013 Clean UI, satisfying driving feel, and fast loading</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed solo with a focus on speed, freedom, and fun \u2014 <i>Velocity Racing: 1000</i> invites you to get behind the wheel and keep chasing distance.</p>","background":"https://st