</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Customization</strong> \u2013 Pick your car color, view handling stats, and fine-tune race rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcca <strong>Progression System</strong> \u2013 Unlock vehicles by driving longer distances and winning races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Steam Co-op Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Join or host races with friends using Steam lobbies, with in-game and lobby chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 End-of-race stats and global rankings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Crisp VFX and Smooth Controls</strong> \u2013 Clean UI, satisfying driving feel, and fast loading</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed solo with a focus on speed, freedom, and fun \u2014 <i>Velocity Racing: 1000</i> invites you to get behind the wheel and keep chasing distance.</p>","developers":["Rumen Kostov"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878690/e6be0d8afbc033cab976b40d2b4b1299b362e696/header.jpg?t=1754309920","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3878690/1840662698/9fcabff022efcb53a551c43487d79b4176e5b362/1752800971/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753120705","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3878690/1840662698/9fcabff022efcb53a551c43487d79b4176e5b362/1752800971/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753120705","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://vid